  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Huh? What do you want? I've every right to be here- oh, it's just you, Wizard. Haha. Whew! Oooh! I'm actually quite glad you're here...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_EMP_01.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Often, the best way to understand a particular subject is to know all you can about the components that comprise said subject matter.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_EMP_02.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Thus, to understand Pekuliarities, we must first understand Pekrons. And I have a theory about how Pekrons form that needs to be investigated.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_EMP_03.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If you would, go to Dragonspyre and use your Gravulum Badge to record a Pekron reading from the Kyanite Lancers who skulk about The Crucible.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_EMP_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Then, go to the nearby Dragonspyre Academy and collect a simple environmental reading. Sound doable? Great! Good luck!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_EMP_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
